---
description: Fuse testing rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Every policy and state transition must have unit tests. Add integration tests
proving a denied decision prevents the underlying tool from executing. Add API
tests for idempotency, invalid policy input, replay immutability, and ordered event
writes. Add Playwright tests for start, breaker trip, timeline inspection, policy
update, safe completion, reset, and Bedrock failure fallback.

Never mark a feature complete without a test or reproducible verification.
